" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f1d61f3b224069e\" href=\"?note=9f1d61f3b224069e\" title=\"27-df-booleqsys\">27-df-booleqsys</a>。有限逐点析取及空析取见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow(\\bigvee_{i=1}^m f_i)(x)=0\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow(\\bigvee_{i=1}^m f_i)(x)=0\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Boolean disjunction is zero exactly when every disjunct is zero.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-booleqsys","status":"resolved","id":"9f1d61f3b224069e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-booleqsys]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-booleqsys","status":"resolved","id":"9f1d61f3b224069e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$(f_i)_{i\\in[m]}\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n^{[m]}$，$\\mathcal F=\\{f_i\\mid i\\in[m]\\}$；$\\mathrm{Sol}_n$ 见 [[27-df-booleqsys]]。有限逐点析取及空析取见 [[27-df-boolop]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$(f_i)_{i\\in[m]}\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n^{[m]}$，$\\mathcal F=\\{f_i\\mid i\\in[m]\\}$；$\\mathrm{Sol}_n$ 见 [[27-df-booleqsys]]。有限逐点析取及空析取见 [[27-df-boolop]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(f_i)_{i\\in[m]}\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n^{[m]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F=\\{f_i\\mid i\\in[m]\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sol}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathrm{Sol}_n(\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow(\\bigvee_{i=1}^m f_i)(x)=0\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":860,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-413","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-eqsysred|thm-eqsysred — Reduction of a Boolean equation system]]"}],"outgoing":["9f1d61f3b224069e","11de8465f2282555"]}